            0.12,
            0.457,
            0.882,
            0.596
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Will this also hold when there are terms having negative numbers as well? Take some more expressions and check. Ans:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Yes, For example: (– 4) + (– 2) = – 6 or (– 2) + (– 4) = – 6 (– 6) + (– 8) = – 14 or (– 8) + (– 6) = – 14 Write some more examples."
            }
          ]
        },
